---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

---
<section class="contact-banner" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <div class="site-container contact-banner-inner">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span>
        </span> A PRÓXIMA CONQUISTA É SUA</p>
      <h2 id="cta-title">Vamos dar a partida<br>
        <em>nessa conversa?</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-banner-action">
      <a class="button button-dark" data-whatsapp href="https://wa.me/5511945194285" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <Icon name="whatsapp" /> Fale com a V4 Machines <Icon name="diagonal" />
      </a>
      <p>Uma mensagem pode ser o começo<br>de uma grande mudança.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <span class="banner-outline" aria-hidden="true">V4</span>
</section>
<section id="contato" class="location section-pad" aria-labelledby="location-title">
  <div class="site-container location-grid">
    <div class="location-content" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span>
        </span> ESPERAMOS POR VOCÊ</p>
      <h2 id="location-title">Sua próxima parada:<br>
        <span>V4 Machines.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="location-description">De perto, a experiência é ainda melhor.<br>Venha conhecer a loja e conversar com a gente.</p>
      <address>
        <Icon name="pin" />
        <span>Rod. João Afonso de Souza Castellano, 18<br>Jardim Tropical · Itaquaquecetuba, SP<br>
          <small>CEP 08577-000</small>
        </span>
      </address>
      <a class="location-phone" href="tel:+5511945194285">
        <Icon name="phone" /> (11) 94519-4285</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=V4+Machines+Rodovia+Joao+Afonso+de+Souza+Castellano+18+Itaquaquecetuba" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Traçar minha rota <Icon name="diagonal" />
      </a>
    </div>
    <a class="location-map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=V4+Machines+Rodovia+Joao+Afonso+de+Souza+Castellano+18+Itaquaquecetuba" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Abrir localização da V4 Machines no Google Maps">
      <div class="map-roads" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="road road-one">
        </span>
        <span class="road road-two">
        </span>
        <span class="road road-three">
        </span>
        <span class="road road-four">
        </span>
        <span class="map-park park-one">
        </span>
        <span class="map-park park-two">
        </span>
        <span class="map-label label-one">ITAQUAQUECETUBA</span>
        <span class="map-label label-two">JARDIM TROPICAL</span>
        <span class="map-label label-three">ROD. JOÃO AFONSO DE SOUZA CASTELLANO</span>
      </div>
      <div class="map-marker">
        <span class="map-marker-icon">V4</span>
        <span>O SEU DESTINO<br>
          <strong>V4 Machines</strong>
        </span>
      </div>
      <span class="map-open">Ver localização no Google Maps <Icon name="diagonal" />
      </span>
      <span class="map-disclaimer">Representação ilustrativa da região</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
